# Moddy Arena: a hotbar wish is kept when he is knocked out in a battle. He makes a Fire Sword with the Apprentice in
# prep and puts it on his hotbar from its page; in the battle he is knocked out with lives left, comes back in the prep
# room with the hotbar wish back in its slot (not dropped in the arena), and the battle goes on: the wish still fires
# in it. Then he runs out of lives (by command), the battle is lost, and in prep again it makes the sword with one
# click.
@intent a player holding a hotbar wish is knocked out in a battle with lives left, comes back in the prep room with the wish in its slot, it still fires in the battle that goes on, and works again after it
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival

@step an Apprentice sword, on his hotbar from its page
moddy apprentice a fire sword
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot 3/ within 60s
@wait 2s
@key key.hotbar.1
@key key.use
@expect screen /make a wish/ within 10s
@click button "My wishes"
@expect screen My wishes within 10s
@click item "Fire Sword"
@expect screen Fire Sword within 10s
@click item "Add to hotbar"
@expect chat On your hotbar, slot 4 within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@shot on-the-hotbar

@step he starts a battle with the button
# every screen closed (the page, and the watch it came from)
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@key key.keyboard.escape
@wait 10t
@expect screen none within 3s
# a couple of steps toward the gate, then the start button on the control panel
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 8t
@wait 10t
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s

@step wave 1, and he is knocked out in the arena
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
# the gate shuts with iron bars as the wave comes and he is taken into the arena; he walks on, holding his hotbar wish,
# and does not fight back: the husks knock him out
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:iron_bars
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 20t
@key key.hotbar.4
@wait 1s
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Knocked out! 2 lives left within 180s
@wait 1s

@step back in the prep room, with the hotbar wish back in its slot, and the battle goes on
# (for 3 seconds: then he is taken back into the arena, 5-battle-lost)
@assert execute if entity @s[x=-4,y=63,z=17,dx=8,dy=3,dz=8]
@repeat 40 until execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
# the wish fires in the battle that goes on: it makes the sword again (a kept thing made again)
@key key.hotbar.4
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot/ within 60s
@wait 1s

@step out of lives, the battle is lost and the arena is tidied
kill @s
@expect chat Knocked out! 1 life left within 10s
@wait 2s
kill @s
@expect chat no lives left within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if items entity @s hotbar.3 minecraft:paper
# it was not dropped: no paper lies anywhere in the place
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item,x=-17,y=60,z=-17,dx=34,dy=20,dz=44,nbt={Item:{id:"minecraft:paper"}}]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 1s
@shot back-in-the-prep-room

@step in prep again, the hotbar wish makes the sword
@key key.hotbar.4
@wait 5t
@assert execute if items entity @s weapon.mainhand minecraft:paper
@key key.use
@expect chat /Fire Sword( [0-9]+)? is in slot/ within 60s
@wait 1s
@shot made-again-after
